{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://wulouniu.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Shorty Gallagher (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that there was a decades-long search for a photograph of <b><a href=\"/wiki/Shorty_Gallagher\" title=\"Shorty Gallagher\">Shorty Gallagher</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i><span style=\"padding-left:0.15em;\">?</span>","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shorty_Gallagher","retrieved":1773643864176},{"title":"an embassy in Fiji (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that, by establishing diplomatic missions like <b><a href=\"/wiki/Embassy_of_the_Philippines,_Suva\" title=\"Embassy of the Philippines, Suva\">an embassy in Fiji</a></b>, the Philippine government hopes to play a bigger role in international politics?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Embassy_of_the_Philippines,_Suva","retrieved":1773643864176},{"title":"Lucie Stern (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the head of one piano department called <b><a href=\"/wiki/Lucie_Stern\" title=\"Lucie Stern\">Lucie Stern</a></b> \"the rarest talent of any child I ever heard\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lucie_Stern","retrieved":1773643864227},{"title":"a carnival group in Brazil (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/Sargento_Pimenta\" title=\"Sargento Pimenta\">a carnival group in Brazil</a></b> plays songs by the Beatles in carnival march rhythms?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sargento_Pimenta","retrieved":1773643864227},{"title":"Palm Beach Biltmore (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Francisco Batista, the brother of ousted president <a href=\"/wiki/Fulgencio_Batista\" title=\"Fulgencio Batista\">Fulgencio Batista</a>, fled to the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Palm_Beach_Biltmore\" title=\"Palm Beach Biltmore\">Palm Beach Biltmore</a></b> immediately after the <a href=\"/wiki/Cuban_Revolution\" title=\"Cuban Revolution\">Cuban Revolution</a> and stated \"We'll be back after the trouble is over\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palm_Beach_Biltmore","retrieved":1773643864228},{"title":"Chronicles from the Siege (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a review of <i><b><a href=\"/wiki/Chronicles_from_the_Siege\" title=\"Chronicles from the Siege\">Chronicles from the Siege</a></b></i> called it \"a meditation on the endurance and fragmentation of Palestinian life under siege\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chronicles_from_the_Siege","retrieved":1773643864229},{"title":"Rebecca Landon (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <a href=\"/wiki/Shakers\" title=\"Shakers\">Shaker</a> leader <b><a href=\"/wiki/Rebecca_Landon\" title=\"Rebecca Landon\">Rebecca Landon</a></b> said in 1842 that she experienced a vision that warned that the United States would face divine judgment for practicing slavery?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rebecca_Landon","retrieved":1773643864232},{"title":"a 2018 data breach at British Airways (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a href=\"/wiki/British_Airways_data_breach\" title=\"British Airways data breach\">a 2018 data breach at British Airways</a></b> was traced to just 22 lines of injected <a href=\"/wiki/JavaScript\" title=\"JavaScript\">JavaScript</a> on its payment pages?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/British_Airways_data_breach","retrieved":1773643864233},{"title":"her convent (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that in 1988 a young nun was kidnapped from <b><a href=\"/wiki/Daughters_of_Mary,_Mother_of_Our_Savior\" title=\"Daughters of Mary, Mother of Our Savior\">her convent</a></b> by her own family?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Daughters_of_Mary,_Mother_of_Our_Savior","retrieved":1773643864235},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\" about=\"#mwt7\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;